    <string name="sc_section_disclosure">Honest disclosure</string>
    <string name="sc_disclosure_bridge">The bridge listens on 127.0.0.1 only and checks a token injected into the engine. On rooted devices this protection is weaker.</string>
    <string name="sc_disclosure_review">With model review on, the action, its reason and a short target-text summary are sent to the review service you configured — no other screen content leaves the device.</string>
    <string name="sc_disclosure_session">"Allow for this session" covers every later operation of this engine run and dies with the engine restart. There is no permanent exemption.</string>
    <string name="sc_disclosure_audit">The audit trail keeps the last 200 decisions on this device, unredacted, clearable any time.</string>
    <string name="sc_disclosure_marquee">The marquee is a visual hint, not a security boundary; the notification\'s "stop" action is the emergency switch. System apps that hide overlays (e.g. Settings) also hide the border.</string>
